{
    "title": "Trap Master - Squish Enemies",
    "description": "Get ready for action in Trap Master, the thrilling defense game where strategy meets excitement! In this addictive game, your goal is to stop a wave of enemies that emerge from a mysterious tube. As they march forward, you have to place traps and squish them!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\nEndless Enemy Waves: Battle against an ever-increasing number of enemies, each wave bringing a new challenge.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlace and Upgrade Traps: Set up a variety of traps to defeat your foes. Upgrade the traps to squish enemies faster.\r\n\r\n\r\nUnique Levels: Play across many different stages, each with its own set of challenges. Complete a stage to progress to the next one.\r\n\r\nEarn Gold for Upgrades: Completing stages earns you gold, which you can use for permanent upgrades.\r\n\r\nEngaging Graphics and Sound: Enjoy captivating graphics and sound effects that enhance your gaming experience.",
